feature context_float_provider entry/distance
  > Get the distance from the origin of the ray to the point where it enters what it hits. Use it in a command of the ray.
  authors: Aksiome
  created: 2026/10/13 26.3
  updated: 2026/10/19 26.3

  output result: float @ 0.. > distance in blocks


feature context_float_provider exit/distance
  > Get the distance from the origin of the ray to the point where it leaves what it hits. Use it in `on_exit`.
  authors: Aksiome
  created: 2026/10/13 26.3
  updated: 2026/10/19 26.3

  output result: float @ 0.. > distance in blocks


feature context_float_provider entry/x
  > Get the x coordinate of the point where the ray enters what it hits, relative to the block it hits, or to the feet of the entity it hits. Use it in a command of the ray.
  authors: Aksiome
  created: 2026/10/19 26.3
  updated: 2026/10/19 26.3

  output result: float > x coordinate in blocks, from the west side of the block or from the feet of the entity


feature context_float_provider entry/y
  > Get the y coordinate of the point where the ray enters what it hits, relative to the block it hits, or to the feet of the entity it hits. Use it in a command of the ray.
  authors: Aksiome
  created: 2026/10/19 26.3
  updated: 2026/10/19 26.3

  output result: float > y coordinate in blocks, from the bottom side of the block or from the feet of the entity


feature context_float_provider entry/z
  > Get the z coordinate of the point where the ray enters what it hits, relative to the block it hits, or to the feet of the entity it hits. Use it in a command of the ray.
  authors: Aksiome
  created: 2026/10/19 26.3
  updated: 2026/10/19 26.3

  output result: float > z coordinate in blocks, from the north side of the block or from the feet of the entity


feature context_float_provider exit/x
  > Get the x coordinate of the point where the ray leaves what it hits, relative to the block it hits, or to the feet of the entity it hits. Use it in `on_exit`.
  authors: Aksiome
  created: 2026/10/19 26.3
  updated: 2026/10/19 26.3

